  - name: "The orb"
    description: "The true Dirari is a soccer-ball-sized blue sphere. Hit Points and S.D.C. apply entirely to the orb, a small moving target: an attacker must make a Called/Aimed Shot, and even then is -2 to strike. A.R. 16 against non-Mega-Damage attacks only. Not a Mega-Damage creature in any environment, though every 100 points of H.P. and S.D.C. equals about one M.D.C.; once an enemy realizes it, the orb is quite vulnerable (6 to 36 M.D.C.) unless protected by a Psychic Body Field or similar force field."
