lus at_level 3, 6, 9 and 12; level 16 is beyond the 15-level ladder and is not stored. Impervious to disease, cold and heat: ability text. || SKILLS: base is catalog base plus printed bonus. Native Tongue (Dirari) at 98%. One W.P. Ancient and one W.P. Modern: choose-1 lists of the ancient and modern rows (the ancient list follows the existing W.P. Ancient precedent). RELATED: five plus one at levels 4, 9 and 12, category bonuses as printed. SECONDARY: four plus one at levels 3, 6, 9 and 12. || PSIONICS: Master Psionic. At first level Alter Aura, Mind Block, Sixth Sense and Psychic Body Field (around the orb, not the body) granted, plus ten picks from Healing, Physical and Sensitive. I.S.P.: M.E. +2D6x10 +30, plus 10 per level. Level 2: two H/P/S and one Super except Mind Wipe, Psi-Sword and Mentally Possess Others; level 3: two H/P/S and one Super including those three; level 4: one Super; from level 5 on one H/P/S per level; one additional Super at levels 7, 9, 11 and 14. Stored as powers_schedule entries. || EQUIPMENT: 3D6 articles of clothing stored as one clothing row; coat or cloak as hooded-cloak; backpack, utility/ammo belt (utility-ammo-belt), canteen, survival knife (1D6 S.D.C.) and food rations for a week (food-rations, one) by slug. The M.D. and S.D.C. firearms of choice name no item: restriction line. MONEY: 3D6x1,000 Universal Credits. || TAGS: stealth (spying, tailing, theft). Not flyer: the flight is psionic-powered, which the tag rules exclude, though it costs no I.S.P.; a judgement call. Not supernatural: the book says they are mortal beings. || NOT STORED: pronunciation DEER-rarr-ree, also known as Orb Men, Orb Ghosts and Ghost Spheres; size (a soccer-ball orb over a 5-6 foot body), weight 20 lbs, life span 3D6+85, diet, habitat, slave market value (unknown), allies and enemies are in GM Notes. Experience Level 1D4+2 for NPCs is a population figure."
